body:
@privy-io/react-auth declares its Solana packages as optional peers but imports
them from its ESM build, so without them the root layout failed to compile and
every page, the sign-in included, answered 500. @solana/kit, @solana-program/system,
@solana-program/token and @solana-program/memo are now direct dependencies.

@worldcoin/idkit and @worldcoin/idkit-core are added in the same install for the
Selfie Check work, so this machine resolved and linked once instead of twice.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
